universe of origin : the inference layer — the electron in the snowstorm
seal               : Strip away everything an AI seems to do — reason, converse, create — and one act remains underneath all of it: predict the next token. From a blizzard of possibilities, the model assigns a probability to every word it could say next, and picks one. Then it does it again, with that word now part of the question. The electron, choosing its path through the snowstorm, one step at a time.
